 // canonicalInvar X' > canonicalInvar X + δ₀ }","sourcePassages":[{"project":"tc-alggeom","projectName":"Tau Ceti · Algebraic Geometry","declaration":"cone_theorem_extremal_contraction","file":"TauCeti/AlgGeom/Birational/MinimalModel.lean","line":119,"url":"https://github.com/tauceti-math/tauceti/blob/main/TauCeti/AlgGeom/Birational/MinimalModel.lean#L119","snippet":"theorem cone_theorem_extremal_contraction (X : KLTVariety) (R : ExtremalRay X) :\n    K_X.intersect R < 0 → ∃ (c : ContractionMorphism X), c.contractsExactly R"},{"project":"oai-hodge","projectName":"OpenAI · Tropical & Combinatorial Hodge Theory","declaration":"hodge_riemann_ample_cone_positivity","file":"OpenAI/Hodge/CombinatorialLefschetz.lean","line":88,"url":"https://github.com/openai/openai-math/blob/main/OpenAI/Hodge/CombinatorialLefschetz.lean#L88","snippet":"theorem hodge_riemann_ample_cone_positivity (L : AmpleCone X) (α :PrimitiveClass X) :\n    0 ≤ (-1)^k * IntersectionPairing α (L.lefschetz α)"},{"project":"poincare","projectName":"Community · 3D Poincaré & Geometric Topology","declaration":"ricci_surgery_volume_decrement","file":"Poincare/RicciFlow/SurgeryTermination.lean","line":134,"url":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/poincare/blob/main/Poincare/RicciFlow/SurgeryTermination.lean#L134","snippet":"theorem ricci_surgery_volume_decrement (M : Manifold3D) (t : SurgeryTime) :\n    ReducedVolume (PostSurgery M t) ≤ ReducedVolume (PreSurgery M t) - δ_neck"}],"intuitionAnalogy":"Like assembling a panoramic photograph from overlapping camera shots whose pairwise overlaps match on triple intersections.","sourceAstBefore":"-- Before Cross-Domain Transfer in `erdos-problems` (Unresolved Bottleneck):\nstructure erdos_problems_Bottleneck where\n  rawDefect   : Nat\n  noiseLevel  : Nat\n  -- Missing structural decomposition & monotone contraction lemma\n  -- Cannot certify rawDefect = 0 without external invariant","targetAstPatched":"-- After Surgical Patch from `carleson` via `Nisan–Wigderso